Package: reelabel
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ares-projects-H
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libegl1
Homepage: https://github.com/ares-projects-H/reelabel
Description: Safe offline media file renamer
 Reelabel previews and validates movie, series, subtitle, and containing-folder
 renames before applying only the changes approved by the user.
